    ('33761', 0, $$It was a scorching hot sunny day. Dudu and Themba decided to go to the park. They bought coldrinks on the way.$$),
    ('33761', 1, $$Soon they were relaxing on the grass in the shade. Dudu was drinking red berry cooldrink. Themba was drinking cream soda cooldrink.$$),
    ('33761', 2, $$They were enjoying being together. But their relaxation was disturbed. They heard loud voices nearby.$$),
    ('33761', 3, $$It was two kids arguing. The boy wanted to play soccer. The girl wanted to swim.$$),
    ('33761', 4, $$It's so hot, let's cool down! " said the girl. The boy was annoyed and began to sulk. He kicked his soccer ball high into the air.$$),
    ('33761', 5, $$The ball fell in the direction of Dudu and Themba. It crashed down, hitting their drinks! Red and green liquid splashed across Dudu's white shirt.$$),
    ('33761', 6, $$Themba grabbed the ball, and popped it with his pen knife! The boy ran up to Dudu and Themba "I am sorry! I am sorry! " he cried.$$),
    ('33761', 7, $$Dudu scolded, "You caused this mess with your arguing. " "Being together is more important than the things you DO together," she said. And the sun smiled.$$),
